WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.900
<i>Due to the power of the Numbers
 that were scattered across the world,</i>

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.000
<i>our world has started to merge with the Barian's!</i>

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:09.860
<i>In order to prevent it from happening, Kaito challenged Heartland to a Duel,</i>

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.240
<i>and took massive damage.</i>

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.620
<i>If this keeps up...</i>

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.030
<i>But just then...!</i>

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.750
I-Impossible...!

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.910
Does this mean you two made it back?!

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.160
You both made it back safely!

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:26.380
Yuma! I <i>purr</i>lieved you would!

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.140
To summarize, you deserve congratulations!

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.420
Yuma!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.380
Sorry to make you worry, guys!

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.000
Yuma, Kaito...

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:37.060
Kaito!

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.600
You okay, Kaito?! Kaito!

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:44.210
Hey! Pull yourself together! Hey!

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.340
You're late...

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:49.800
Sorry!

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:51.980
Slow coach...

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:55.300
Kaito!

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.680
V, look after Kaito.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.370
I will.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:05.870
Unforgivable...

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:10.040
I won't forgive you no matter what you do, Heartland!

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:12.760
Hmph... Then what will you <i>do</i> about it?

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:17.170
We're gonna take over this Duel!

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:21.060
Foolish beyond belief.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:27.120
To think you would actually take over 
a losing Duel with only 1750 Life...

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:31.600
I suppose I should thank you for saving me the effort!

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:37.490
With this, my spot as one of the Seven Barian Emperors is confirmed!

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:39.620
So, why don't we begin?

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:42.070
So that's your true form, is it?!

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:43.650
Here goes!

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.320
Duel Disk, set!

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.990
D-Gazer, set!

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:56.510
Duel!!

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:08.940
Wh-What's with this damage?

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:14.400
This human world is being changed into the Barian Field.

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:16.360
Into the Barian's Field?!

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:17.620
Correct.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.120
Suffer and suffer more!

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.370
Astral...

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.480
It's okay, Yuma...

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:32.600
Let's win this Duel.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:34.440
Yeah!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.550
I activate Kaito's Prevent Draw!

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:42.170
Once activated, this card lets me draw one card!

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:45.880
I draw one card!

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.000
Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.920
Such useless effort!

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:53.760
You'll be done for with this one attack alone!

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:56.960
Baal Zebul attacks directly!

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:00.380
I activate Rainbow Kuriboh's effect from my hand!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:05.260
When one of the opponent's Xyz Monsters attacks, Rainbow Kuriboh

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.920
can equip itself to that attacking Monster,

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:13.960
and negate the attacking Monster's attack!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.800
Fine then.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:22.800
I'll save the excitement for later.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.380
I set one card and end my turn!

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.540
He pulled through somehow...

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.820
Watch me...

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:32.580
... Kaito!

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:39.520
Nasch! Merag!

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.120
<i>Impossible...! These guys were actually alive?</i>

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.760
<i>Back then those two should have already been dead...!</i>

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.980
What's wrong, Vector?

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.920
N-Nothing...

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.520
They were on Earth.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:57.410
As the human forms known as Ryouga and Rio Kamishiro!

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.520
What!? Ryouga and Rio!?

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:01.550
That's right.

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:05.080
They had lost their memories as Barians,

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:07.550
living their lives as humans.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.230
<i>This situation's really for the worst...</i>

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:13.040
<i>Do they remember what happened back then?</i>

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:15.480
<i>That I lured the both of them into a trap...?</i>

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:16.720
<i>Do not lose your cool.</i>

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.980
<i>Don Thousand!</i>

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.030
<i>There is no thirst for blood coming from them.</i>

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:26.820
<i>So that means their memories haven't fully resurfaced, huh?</i>

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:27.680
Vector.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:32.120
I understand that you feel doubt toward me.

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:36.870
It's true that Merag and I were once your 
enemies in the Human World.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:40.780
But now we have both awoken as Barians.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:45.680
In order to protect this world, the time has come for us to combine our strength!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:50.240
However, if you see even a hint of my betrayal toward you,

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:52.670
kill me when my back is turned!

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:54.980
Nasch...!

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:57.650
Both mine and Merag's fates...

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.510
...lie with the Barians!

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:04.710
I understand.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.870
By the way, Vector.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.010
Is that your doing?

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:12.320
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:15.250
The Barian World has started to fuse with the Human World.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:19.580
I can't think of anyone other than Don Thousand's power being able to pull off something like this.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:22.900
Someone has revived his power.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.880
I got no clue!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:29.050
Oh yeah! Maybe it's that fly bastard's doing?

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:30.660
You mean Heartland?

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.980
But this is a perfect opportunity for us!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.540
Yuma and Astral aren't there right now.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.490
Let's go to Earth and...

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.420
Vector.

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:43.300
You take Yuma and Astral too lightly.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:44.580
What?!

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.980
They will certainly return.

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:49.130
That's just how they are.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.140
Now let me grant you all power!

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.620
Power in order for you to fight them!

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:02.380
Now let us go!

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:32.640
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.690
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:43.150
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:46.700
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:51.580
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:57.920
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:01.130
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:04.010
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:08.640
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:11.720
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:20.160
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.760
My turn! Draw!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:36.310
Yuma!

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:40.730
<i>Okay</i>! I Summon Gagaga Kaiser!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:47.530
"The Hero's Triumphant Return!
 Carrying On a Friend's Will!!"

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.940
Then I Special Summon Gagaga Clerk from my hand!

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:54.950
When there's a Gagaga Monster on my field,

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.450
she can be Special Summoned!

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.500
Then I activate Gagaga Kaiser's effect!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:05.580
Once per turn, by Banishing one Monster from the Graveyard,

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:11.590
we can change the levels of all Monsters on our field to the level of the Banished Monster!

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:15.390
I select the Level Four Knight of Photon Dragon

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:17.850
and change the levels of the Monsters on our field!

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:25.480
Then I Overlay the Level Four Gagaga Kaiser and Clerk!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:30.110
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.860
Xyz Summon!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:37.740
Show yourself, Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.080
Yuma!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:44.120
Yeah!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:48.590
I use Hope to attack Infection Baal Zebul!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:52.720
Meow?! Hope's Attack Power's higher than his opponent's, meow?!

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.800
Hmph. I've read right through you.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:59.430
You'll use Hope to attack, and then have Moon Barrier negate the attack

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.680
and then activate the Quick-Play Spell card, Double-Up Chance!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:09.900
Idiots! I activate the Counter-Trap, Overlay Hunt!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:15.030
When an Xyz Monster on my field is attacked by the opponent's Monster

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.530
The effect of the attacking Monster is negated

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:21.830
Next, the Overlay Units shall be absorbed by my Monster.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.080
Hope's Overlay Units are...!?

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.540
Now, I've stopped your attack.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:30.290
Your hopes have also been dashed!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.420
Crumble into pieces, Hope!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.760
You're taking us too lightly.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.300
Our formula for victory...

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:38.890
... has barely started playing out!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:39.550
Yes?

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.140
There are other ways to stop the attack.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:47.600
I activate from my hand the Quick-Play Spell card, Stop Hammer!

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:52.070
This card negates the attack of one monster

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.530
... and causes it to lose 500 ATK points!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:58.780
W-What!?

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.030
Usually, this card is to be used when the opponent attacks.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.910
But now it shall be used on Hope!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.870
Now that Hope's attack is negated...

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:12.040
I activate the Quick-Play Spell card, Double-Up Chance!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.510
Oh no~!

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.840
When a monster's attack is negated

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.260
The Attack points are doubled in battle

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:24.720
Once again, it's able to attack!

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.430
Go! Hope!

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.400
Attack Infection Baal Zebul!

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:33.110
Hope Blade Double Slash!

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.580
Aw yeah!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:51.540
Now that the battle is over, Hope's Attack points return to normal.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:56.710
You... you bastards!

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.050
I won't... I won't forgive this!

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:04.430
I activate the Continuous Trap, Infection Medium!

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:08.270
When a Fiend-Type Monster is destroyed this turn

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:13.520
I can Special Summon five new Infection Bug Tokens!

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:15.770
It's multiplied in a beat, meow!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.320
Five Tokens?

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.740
However, they only have 300 Attack points each.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.240
Yuma, be on your guard. There must be something about them.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:24.490
Yeah.

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:27.750
I place one card Face-down and end my turn!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:32.120
Let's go, my turn, Draw!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:37.420
I attack Hope with Infection Bug Token One!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.970
Attacking Hope with 300 Attack points!?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.720
I activate Bug Token's effect!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.730
When it's destroyed, I take zero damage!

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:55.480
And I destroy one monster on the opponent's Field!

00:11:55.690 --> 00:12:00.280
Next! You receive 300 points of damage!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:01.950
W-What the!?

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:10.290
With this, your Field is now stripped naked!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.370
I shall use Bug Token Two...

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.380
...and Direct Attack!

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:18.750
I activate Rainbow Kuriboh's effect!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.880
When I receive a Direct Attack

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.260
I can Special Summon it from the Graveyard!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.510
In that case, Bug Token Two.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.720
Destroy it!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:32.100
Thanks for the help, Rainbow Kuriboh.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.100
What help?

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.770
The show of destruction has only just begun!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:39.320
The trio of Bug Token Three, Four, Five

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.990
shall lift the curtains on my Direct Attack!

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:47.410
Go! Infection Bug Tokens!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.550
Next, as a precaution

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:08.640
I activate from my hand the Continuous Trap, Infection Extension!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.180
When no Monster has been Normal Summoned in a turn...

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:16.480
I can Special Summon one Infection Bug Token!

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:19.150
One bastard little fly's been added.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.610
After this card is activated

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:25.490
The opposing player cannot Summon Monsters in Attack position!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.320
There's nothing they can do other than defend?

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:32.160
When Infection Bug Token is destroyed,

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:35.080
I can use its effect and destroy your Monster

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.830
and cause you to take 300 points of damage!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.250
But, during his turn...

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.630
If they're attacked again...

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.010
With this you guys...

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.130
... are done for~!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.890
It's not over for us yet!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:54.480
Since you Special Summoned a Monster on your side

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:56.730
I activate this!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:59.360
Continuous Trap! Light Back!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:04.490
If there's a Light-Attribute Monster in my Graveyard,

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:08.240
I can Special Summon it after reducing its Attack Points by 1000!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:11.240
Now, the Light-Attribute Monsters you have in your Graveyard is...

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:14.120
Ohh! It must be!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:19.460
I Special Summon Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon from my Graveyard!!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.090
This here is the hope Kaito left for us...

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:27.340
The formula to turn the victory in our favor!

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.680
Fools!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.720
No matter how you use Galaxy-Eyes's effect

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:35.680
how are you going to destroy five Bug Tokens at once!?

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.060
During my next turn, you guys are finished!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.690
I end my turn here!

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.770
Yuma, you get it right?

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:46.360
We have to reverse the situation in our favor by the next turn.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:47.780
Yeah!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:52.410
Drawing the key card

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.240
shall set everything in place!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:59.670
Well, there's only trump card you guys can pull out right here!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.170
It's ZeXal, isn't it!

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:04.800
But that won't work.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.460
Barians...

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:11.550
Just once, lend me your power!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.020
Take this!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.740
Yuma! Astral!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:35.120
How's that! Now can't use the power to turn into ZeXal anymore!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.660
Yuma...

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:39.620
Shit...

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.170
Painful, isn't it!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.380
It is enough pain for you to feel through this duel,

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:48.050
that you would have been happier if you rather hadn't come back!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:54.720
Stop kiddin' yourself.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.970
What?

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.430
No matter how painful it is...

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.480
Astral, I can duel with you...!

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.440
With you...

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:10.150
Being able to duel with you again...

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.950
That's what is happiness for me.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.210
Yuma, those feelings...

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.380
Now I can understand them.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.210
Astral...

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.720
Even with pain like this...

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.340
Yeah, if I'm with you...

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:46.900
What!?

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.650
Im-... impossible!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:50.780
Me with-!

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:51.780
With me!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.200
We're bringing it to 'em!

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.870
I Overlay myself with you!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.330
The two of us build the Overlay Network!

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.080
Our bonds are evolving!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.920
Ever stronger! Ever firmer!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.550
When our bonds come together...!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:14.380
Our hearts and our power become one,

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:17.590
...creating the Legend, the Miracle of the Light!

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:20.850
Xyz Change!

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:24.430
ZeXal!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:29.440
That's...!

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.030
The new...

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:34.610
ZeXal...

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:41.080
You...! How...!?

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:45.460
Holy Light, purify the Base Darkness!

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.380
ZeXal Field!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.840
That's stupid! The power of Barian is...!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:57.760
